    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR02T",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03F/props/StringProp/6lztegyKOqMLJ2wt",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03F/props/StringProp/YC7XLFgnZ9QbwdqF",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Unified.js AST mapping to TerminusDB substrate",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03G",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03G",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03H",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03J",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03K",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03M"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03F",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03G/props/StringProp/cbgAprqFD-3sGyqF",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03G/props/StringProp/lF4pWYloFO9jsbj0",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Granularity mapping",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03H",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03H",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03G",
    "text": "Document level (`root` in mdast) corresponds to the page or section document container node.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03J",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03J",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03G",
    "text": "Block level (`listItem` / `paragraph` in mdast) corresponds to individual outliner blocks with parent-child graph edges.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03K",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03K",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03G",
    "text": "Phrase or entity level (`link` / `span` in hast) corresponds to on-demand reified nodes for addressed inline spans.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03M",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03M",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03G",
    "text": "Word or token level (`nlcst`) acts as ephemeral parser nodes used strictly during transduction passes, reified into graph nodes only when explicitly touched.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03N",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03N",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03P",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03Q"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03F",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03N/props/StringProp/WTN_YuTj5zfIFRs1",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03N/props/StringProp/XMt5_YrVremNBunw",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Offset tracking and synchronization",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03P",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03P",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03N",
    "text": "Unified tracks exact source offsets (`position: {start, end}`) across all AST nodes.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03Q",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03Q",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03N",
    "text": "When an inline span is addressed, the transducer uses offsets to split the parent AST text node and assign an ID to the newly created span node without disturbing surrounding text.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03R",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03R",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03S",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03V",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR047",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04F",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04R",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR052"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTG004",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03R/props/StringProp/6vvisilp04zlimGD",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03R/props/StringProp/kIlg1sFfjkM6cChy",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Development Roadmap of Aperas",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03S",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03S",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03T"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03R",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03S/props/StringProp/tjkJgc5O3Xlva-AO",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03S/props/StringProp/vwqmciJvED6HU-Xw",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Meta-Aperas Ontological Alignment",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03T",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03T",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03S",
    "text": "The engineering roadmap is itself a self-instantiation of the Aperas ontology: starting in the unconditioned substrate (Apeiron) and crystallizing typed interfaces (Perata) on demand as human–agent coordination needs emerge.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03V",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03V",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03W",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03Z",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR041",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR044"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03R",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03V/props/StringProp/DXi_9kM3dRCvpVfQ",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03V/props/StringProp/sJ2O6neEGzp-2rH3",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Phase 0: Infrastructure and basic tools (Apeiron direct)",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03W",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03W",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03X",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03Y"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03V",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03W/props/StringProp/5D6ntcP7jOAvBfsH",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03W/props/StringProp/m2ySciRVoeo46TAu",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Direct database integration",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03X",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03X",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03X",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03W",
    "text": "The primary coding agent connects directly to the **TerminusDB** substrate without any intermediate UI layer.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03Y",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03Y",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03W",
    "text": "System provides baseline skill definitions (`SKILL.md`) covering schema initialization, document CRUD, WOQL and GraphQL query execution, and temporal commit management.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR03Z",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR03Z",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR040"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03V",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03Z/props/StringProp/e0zxXwd1AR6ThlFN",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03Z/props/StringProp/zAO1Dhgf5w7fQibG",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Verification without UI overhead",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR040",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR040",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR040",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03Z",
    "text": "Validates core graph operations, transaction safety, and agent reasoning loops directly against the canonical store.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR041",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR041",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR041",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR042",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR043"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03V",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR041/props/StringProp/pSfuAOrpVI6cILdU",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR041/props/StringProp/stJVVwqB7pIVEi-K",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Basic assertion authoring (moved earlier from Phase 2, see `Aperas-basic-assertion-skill-design.md`)",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR042",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR042",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR042",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR041",
    "text": "`Assertion` (the concrete `BaseEdge`) was already a working CRUD/WOQL primitive; this adds manual CLI commands (`kg:assert`/`kg:assertions`/`kg:unassert`) so a human or agent can actually write and inspect a real one, with no automated traversal or agent behavior attached.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR043",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR043",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR043",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR041",
    "text": "Built here rather than waiting for Phase 1, so Phase 1's skill-building work starts with it already available instead of blocked on it — and ahead of the SolidJS UI, since Artifact Projection (mode 1 of §5.A) already covers the monitoring need the UI was originally assumed to be required for.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR044",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR044",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR044",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR045",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR046"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03V",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR044/props/StringProp/8XkKIK_lmzKBlt9g",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR044/props/StringProp/iBjn1S3zocRvuBqI",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Agentic query tools (moved earlier from Phase 1, see `Aperas-agentic-query-tools-design.md`)",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR045",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR045",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR045",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR044",
    "text": "Mode 3 of §5.A (\"Agentic Interface, BFS Traversal\") made concrete as three CLI tools: `kg:tree` (a deep, title-only structural map — depth-first, not BFS despite the mode's name), `kg:unfold`/`kg:fold` (the real breadth-first primitive — one level, full content, persisting the long-inert `BlockNode.unfolded` flag for the first time), and `kg:search` (keyword/regex content search via WOQL, closing a previously-unfilled gap).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR046",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR046",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR046",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR044",
    "text": "Moved here for the same reason as basic assertion authoring: closes the block-level addressing gap that authoring left open, and doesn't need the UI to exist first.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR047",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR047",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR047",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR048",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04A",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04D"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03R",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR047/props/StringProp/oqX-Da4kJHVKK4mU",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR047/props/StringProp/x6tduOuOqDpoACXN",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Phase 1: Core skills & UI Peras (Human–agent co-navigation)",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR048",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR048",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR048",
