      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR048/props/StringProp/MHCkGdVYmp1LG7iw",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Apeiron operating skills",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR049",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR049",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR049",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR048",
    "text": "Agent Skills (`SKILL.md`) teaching a coding agent how to use the CLI to operate and manage the KG.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04A",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04A",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04B",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04C"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR047",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04A/props/StringProp/KaqroC2uANwg5zD1",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04A/props/StringProp/O5KpkmLdYCObVW5O",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "SolidJS read projection",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04B",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04B",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04A",
    "text": "Constructs the initial **SolidJS + Unified.js** projection interface for deep-read human inspection.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04C",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04C",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04A",
    "text": "Renders continuous Markdown outliner trees directly from TerminusDB AST nodes.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04D",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04D",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04E"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR047",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04D/props/StringProp/hwX43yHbF8U1YgaK",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04D/props/StringProp/iirR4leLtQW7gkux",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Multi-faceted node interface",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04E",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04E",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04D",
    "text": "Surface projections reveal the multi-tab reference model (Article, Source, Talk, History) so humans and agents navigate the exact same operational state.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04F",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04F",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04G",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04J",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04M"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03R",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04F/props/StringProp/HBZLa0Gonm-Lc0nh",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04F/props/StringProp/ae0CO6DvMr15_qDk",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Phase 2: Skill expansion and perata maturation",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04G",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04G",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04H"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04F",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04G/props/StringProp/OjKSQyTegnIKydiE",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04G/props/StringProp/jIVAfZZh08lfuj9Z",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Incremental capability growth",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04H",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04H",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04G",
    "text": "Develops specialized procedural skills including ingestion (parsing external text into AST nodes), *automated* graph search (structural traversals and WOQL/GraphQL pattern matching, with vector support evaluated later — the manual assertion primitive itself moved to Phase 1, above), and refactoring (lazy atomization of spans and node merging).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04J",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04J",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04K"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04F",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04J/props/StringProp/DVmzVoYPktRft00V",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04J/props/StringProp/pWFEsOpk5Ujlnhxn",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Co-evolution of tools and perata",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04K",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04K",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04J",
    "text": "Each new skill definition naturally introduces corresponding tooling and new **perata** (specialized view projections).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04M",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04M",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04N",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04P",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Q"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04F",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04M/props/StringProp/FU_B7Zd3L_2WUewT",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04M/props/StringProp/pmQO-g_akgKUfEmN",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Collaboration perata: review/merge-request workflow",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04N",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04N",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04M",
    "text": "TerminusDB's `rebase`/`apply` give branch reconciliation but no GitHub-style review layer — no proposal-with-discussion, approval state, or inline comment thread sits between \"diverged branches\" and \"merged.\"",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04P",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04P",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04M",
    "text": "Aperas extends the multi-faceted node model (Discourse view / Talk) to a first-class review document type: a proposal node wrapping a source/target branch pair, with discussion threads, review state, and conflict-resolution notes stored as subdocuments in the KG rather than in an external tool.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04Q",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04Q",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04M",
    "text": "Keeps Aperas GitHub-like as well as Git-like: comments, issues, and review decisions become graph-native, queryable, and provenance-tracked alongside the commits they discuss, instead of living in a bolted-on external system.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04R",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04R",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04S",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04W",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Y"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03R",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04R/props/StringProp/VKgN9xRKlvnLWlKa",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04R/props/StringProp/mrHUM1A1dzeoWvNQ",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Phase 3: Multi-agent specialization and Aperas Agent interfaces",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04S",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04S",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04T",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04V"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04R",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04S/props/StringProp/bLZSDKtv50st8TSw",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04S/props/StringProp/wtsU3XW8k4Jrz7H2",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Sub-agent spawning for coding agents without background API access",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04T",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04T",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04S",
    "text": "Equips primary coding agents with specialized `SKILL.md` definitions that allow them to spawn local sub-agents via headless CLI calls, native sub-agent tools, or local execution scripts.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04V",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04V",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04S",
    "text": "Preserves the direct Phase 0/2 skill set so local coding agents perform deep structural graph operations, AST transductions, and multi-node updates using existing lab harnesses without secondary API costs.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04W",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04W",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04X"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04R",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04W/props/StringProp/JKL-3Ccxb6Pjjosp",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04W/props/StringProp/lPYl2F2J0OjTGPVO",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Dedicated agent swarms (API-enabled environments)",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04X",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04X",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04X",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04W",
    "text": "For environments with secondary API access, specialized multi-agent subgraphs (built with **LangGraph**) run on dedicated model endpoints for complex background tasks.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04Y",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04Y",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Z",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR050",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR051"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04R",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Y/props/StringProp/AVaTmlveqg1SD_Kl",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Y/props/StringProp/Ti4dghds0_8ak-bH",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Triple interface continuum for user coding agents",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR04Z",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR04Z",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Y",
    "text": "**Manual skill mode (procedural / CLI execution):** The coding agent executes raw procedural skills (`SKILL.md`) directly against the substrate, preserving full operational autonomy without API dependencies.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR050",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR050",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR050",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Y",
    "text": "**Tool mode (active query):** Exposes high-level perata tools and service endpoints for the coding agent to interact directly with the Aperas Agent on demand.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR051",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR051",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR051",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR04Y",
    "text": "**Hook mode (automatic context engineering):** Injects perata and context projections directly into the context window of the coding agent via background events and triggers.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR052",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR052",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR052",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR053",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR056",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0000",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0003"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR03R",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR052/props/StringProp/9LRGXdxb7cCzShln",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR052/props/StringProp/UaXUnqqP6Sx2CbaI",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Phase 4: Substrate Evolution — ApeironNgn (native Rust successor, speculative)",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR053",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR053",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR053",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR054",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR055"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR052",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR053/props/StringProp/_EeDrQ5pofYexB6n",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR053/props/StringProp/riKEjmsUo8LU0u-o",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Motivation: right-sizing the substrate to what Aperas actually exercises",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR054",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR054",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR054",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR053",
    "text": "TerminusDB Community brings a general-purpose Prolog/WOQL Datalog engine, enterprise-oriented tooling, and its own bundle/layer format for versioning — capability well beyond what Phase 0-3 skills exercise (document CRUD, one-hop impact traversal, branch/commit/merge as a review workflow).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR055",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR055",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR055",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR053",
    "text": "The bidirectional JSON-LD mirror (`AperasKG/Apeiron/`, `Aperas-architecture.md` §5) demonstrates this directly: the canonical graph content already round-trips as plain JSON-LD files, decoupled from TerminusDB's own storage internals — nothing about the substrate's actual content depends on TerminusDB being the engine underneath it.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR056",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR056",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR056",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR057",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR058"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR052",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR056/props/StringProp/tZwot94hyRNKrtvh",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR056/props/StringProp/wvhvv6JJ4BbyH5WA",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "ApeironNgn: a minimal engine sized to exactly what Aperas needs",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR057",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR057",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR057",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR056",
    "text": "A small, embeddable Rust graph engine scoped to the primitives Phase 0-3 actually use: the `BaseNode`/`BaseLink`/`BaseEdge` document model and simple pattern-match queries (source/predicate/target lookups, bounded-depth traversal) — no general Datalog/Prolog solver, no auto-generated GraphQL schema, no multi-tenant/enterprise surface.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR058",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCTR058",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCTR058",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR056",
    "text": "No separate commit-layer engine to build: `AperasKG/Apeiron/` already lives inside a real git repository, so a JSON-LD write followed by an ordinary `git commit` over that directory *is* the version control — immutable history, diffing, and branching all come from git itself, not a bespoke bundle/layer format ApeironNgn would otherwise have to reimplement. TerminusDB needed its own commit-layer machinery because it owns an opaque store with no git underneath it; once Aperas is managing history directly against `AperasKG/Apeiron/`, ApeironNgn doesn't need to.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV0000",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV0000",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0001",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0002"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR052",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0000/props/StringProp/WJjWqInFMrXkjH4k",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0000/props/StringProp/sAb2M9xjGZRtsjhX",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Migration surface: the same modules stand in for the same role, one changing shape",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV0001",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV0001",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0000",
    "text": "`client.ts`, `crud.ts`, `woql.ts`, and `graphql.ts` (`Aperas-architecture.md` §3) already isolate every TerminusDB-specific call behind a small, named set of modules — that boundary is what ApeironNgn would need to implement to stand in for TerminusDB, with `AperasKG/Apeiron/` as the on-disk state `kg:export`/`kg:import` already round-trip through.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV0002",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV0002",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0000",
    "text": "`versionControl.ts` doesn't carry over as-is — its branch/commit/diff/merge calls would delegate straight to real `git` operations on the `AperasKG` repository instead of TerminusDB's git-like API, since the KG's \"commit\" *is* a git commit once ApeironNgn is the engine.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV0003",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV0003",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0004"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTR052",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0003/props/StringProp/ZfLSKzqzw7PYiou3",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0003/props/StringProp/jTdOM7chsg2ifaNS",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Status: unscheduled and speculative",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV0004",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV0004",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0003",
    "text": "Contingent on Phase 0-3 confirming that TerminusDB Community edition's rough edges — cross-store `bundle`/`unbundle` incompatibility (`terminusdb/terminusdb#2509`) and the `List`-typed `@unfold` gap (`terminusdb/terminusdb#2512`), both documented in `Aperas-dev-status.md` — are structural rather than incidental before committing engineering effort to a replacement.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV0005",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV0005",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0006",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000Q"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCTG004",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0005/props/StringProp/byTEqgdu8H5jKLrj",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0005/props/StringProp/iT3ZjcF6beXDQKJj",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Open-Source Stack for Agentic Knowledge Graph Architectures",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
