      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0007/props/StringProp/JPj17Dj6oFQulq8P",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Canonical graph storage layer (the substrate)",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV0008",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV0008",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0007",
    "text": "**TerminusDB** (chosen primary substrate) provides revision control on knowledge graphs with Git-like branches, delta layers, diffs, and merge requests.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV0009",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV0009",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0007",
    "text": "**FalkorDB** and **Neo4j Community** offer property graph engines with sub-millisecond Cypher querying.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000A",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000A",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0007",
    "text": "**SQLite** and **DuckDB** with DuckPGQ offer local-first, lightweight deployments.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000B",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000B",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000C",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000D"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0006",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000B/props/StringProp/kmycKrgYs48wYGp-",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000B/props/StringProp/zwN8fJcxe8BrhTrX",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "UI rendering and projection layer",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000C",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000C",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000B",
    "text": "**SolidJS** (chosen UI framework) provides fine-grained signal-based reactivity without Virtual DOM overhead for rendering deep-read outliners and reified inline spans.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000D",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000D",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000B",
    "text": "**React Flow** / **XYFlow** and **Mermaid.js** offer visual graph and diagram rendering utilities.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000E",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000E",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000F",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000G"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0006",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000E/props/StringProp/gBuwnNkNv8vx5_fx",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000E/props/StringProp/hsNFSmQj2GcUOWfY",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Agent swarm and orchestration layer",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000F",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000F",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000E",
    "text": "**LangGraph** enables stateful, cyclical multi-agent orchestration to model read–write loops across intake, validation, and impact sweep agents.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000G",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000G",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000E",
    "text": "**PydanticAI** provides type-safe, schema-guided agent definitions ensuring outputs adhere to exact block-tree entity schemas.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000H",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000H",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000J",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000K",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000M"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV0006",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000H/props/StringProp/ZZoXA1YeuyDPrOgc",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000H/props/StringProp/qBrlUw2MqvjW-2kA",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Interoperability, procedures, and boundary validation",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000J",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000J",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000H",
    "text": "**Agent Skills** (`SKILL.md`) serves as an open standard for defining modular, loadable agent instructions and view templates.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000K",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000K",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000H",
    "text": "**TypeBox** / **Zod** (TypeScript) and **Pydantic** (Python) serve as boundary transducers enforcing schema contracts at network edges.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000M",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000M",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000H",
    "text": "Direct Service APIs (GraphQL or REST) serve as direct communication interfaces between agents and backend services.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZCV000N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZCV000N",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZCV000N",
    "children": [
