    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZHS001A",
    "text": "**Projection Engines (Phase 1)**: the Human UI (SolidJS read-projection, 'Hover Preview' link mechanism) remains undesigned — of the three modes in `Aperas-core-ontology-design.md` §5.A, mode 1 (Artifact Projection, now covering both `ArtifactNode` and `FolderNode` — see \"Markdown → Fractal Tree Mapping\" above) is implemented and mode 3 (Agentic Interface) is designed (Phase 0, above); only mode 2 (Human UI) is still untouched. Mode 1 now also writes to disk by default (`kg:project`, `--dry-run` to print instead) rather than print-only, per `Aperas-core-ontology-design.md` §1.B's \"the DB becomes the source of truth\" model.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZHS001C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZHS001C",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZHS001C",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZHS001A",
    "text": "**Assertion skill(s) (Phase 1)**: a loadable `SKILL.md` teaching a coding agent when/how to use the `kg:assert`/`kg:assertions`/`kg:unassert` CLI (built in Phase 0, above) — not yet designed.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZHS001D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
