    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZHS001A",
    "text": "Phase 2+ skills: ingestion-from-arbitrary-sources, *automated* graph search skill (the manual assertion primitive moved to Phase 0, see below), refactoring/lazy-atomization skill.",
