    "text": "Symptom: `aperas_apeiron_snapshot_A.bundle` (made on Host A) and `aperas_apeiron_snapshot_B.bundle` (made on Host B) each verify cleanly **only on their own origin machine**, and fail deterministically with `error(unknown_layer_reference(<hash>))` on the other — a different specific missing-layer hash each time.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZHS8001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZHS8001",
