    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "# The Aperas Extensibility Model: Apeiron to Perata",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK8R001",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R002",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R003",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R007"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R000",
    "text": "Aperas is not a monolithic application with a single, closed database; it is an engine for growing forms (Perata) out of a formless core (Apeiron).",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK8R002",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK8R002",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R001",
    "text": "Because there will be many different Domain KGs (e.g., `ArchitectureKG`, `PersonalKG`, `ProjectX_KG`), the boundary between the Core and the Domain must support deep **extension and refinability**.",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "## 1. Core vs. Community Governance",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK8R003",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R004"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R001",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK8R004",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK8R004",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R005",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R006"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R003",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R004/props/StringProp/BpnwSL3szOxSm9-j",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R004/props/StringProp/Qb1UdmLdpM_gWbDn",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "*   **Aperas (The Apeiron Core):** Managed by the Core Dev Team. It provides the universal potential: the database driver, the base universal schemas (`BaseNode`, `BaseLink`, `BaseEdge`, `BlockNode`, `ArtifactNode`), and the infrastructure tooling (like `restore.sh`).\n*   **A Domain KG (The Perata):** Managed by the Community. A specific KG repository (like `AperasKG`) is a specific materialization. It contains the raw content (`artifacts/`), **and** the specific logic that defines its shape (its Schemas, Ontologies, and Transducers).",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK8R005",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK8R005",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R004",
    "text": "**Aperas (The Apeiron Core):** Managed by the Core Dev Team. It provides the universal potential: the database driver, the base universal schemas (`BaseNode`, `BaseLink`, `BaseEdge`, `BlockNode`, `ArtifactNode`), and the infrastructure tooling (like `restore.sh`).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK8R006",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK8R006",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R004",
    "text": "**A Domain KG (The Perata):** Managed by the Community. A specific KG repository (like `AperasKG`) is a specific materialization. It contains the raw content (`artifacts/`), **and** the specific logic that defines its shape (its Schemas, Ontologies, and Transducers).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "## 2. Mechanisms of Extension (OOP & Composition)",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK8R007",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R008",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90000",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90006"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R001",
    "text": "The technical implementation of this extensibility leverages Object-Oriented polymorphism in TerminusDB and functional composition in TypeScript.",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "### A. Schema Extension (`@inherits`)",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK8R008",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R009",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R00A"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R007",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R008/props/StringProp/-rvQAuj5PicBMhJS",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R008/props/StringProp/7Jh1AK0IffUlamvJ",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Domain KGs can define custom node shapes that natively inherit properties from the Aperas Core nodes using the `@inherits` JSON-LD keyword.",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK8R009",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK8R009",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R008",
    "text": "**Property Inheritance**: A domain `RequirementNode` inheriting from `BlockNode` automatically gains `title`, `text`, and `children`, plus its own specific fields like `priority`.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R00A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK8R00A",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK8R00A",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R008",
    "text": "**Subsumption (Polymorphism)**: TerminusDB natively understands this inheritance Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG). A query for `BlockNode` will automatically return all `RequirementNode` instances. *(See the official [TerminusDB Schema Reference Guide](https://terminusdb.org/docs/schema-reference-guide/#inherits) for details).*",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "### B. Ontology Extension (Edge Subclassing)",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK90000",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90001",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90002"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R007",
    "text": "Aperas adopts **Edge Subclassing (OOP)** for defining predicates and relationships. \nInstead of relying on fragile string fields, relationships are modeled as abstract schema classes (e.g., `BaseEdge`). A Domain KG can define specific relationships that inherit from these bases:",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK90001",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK90001",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90000",
    "text": "```json\n{ \"@id\": \"AffectsEdge\", \"@type\": \"Class\", \"@inherits\": [\"BaseEdge\"], \"source\": \"BlockNode\", \"target\": \"BlockNode\" }\n{ \"@id\": \"BlocksEdge\", \"@type\": \"Class\", \"@inherits\": [\"AffectsEdge\"] }\n```",
    "type": "code",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK90002",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK90002",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90003"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90000",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90002/props/StringProp/0xnKpGvHNoUMLpIZ",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90002/props/StringProp/89hVl8V2ZLAaz3h1",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "*   **WOQL Subsumption Query**: Because the edge is an object in a hierarchy, you query it using `isa()`, which natively understands subsumption. *(See the [WOQL Class Reference Guide](https://terminusdb.org/docs/woql-class-reference-guide/#is-a) for details on `isa`)*.\n    ```javascript\n    WOQL.isa(\"v:EdgeId\", \"AffectsEdge\")\n        .triple(\"v:EdgeId\", \"source\", \"v:NodeA\")\n        .triple(\"v:EdgeId\", \"target\", \"v:NodeB\")\n    ```\n    This single query automatically fetches all `AffectsEdge` instances **and** all domain-specific `BlocksEdge` instances seamlessly, with strict typing constraints.",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK90003",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK90003",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90004",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90005"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90002",
    "text": "**WOQL Subsumption Query**: Because the edge is an object in a hierarchy, you query it using `isa()`, which natively understands subsumption. *(See the [WOQL Class Reference Guide](https://terminusdb.org/docs/woql-class-reference-guide/#is-a) for details on `isa`)*.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK90004",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK90004",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90003",
    "text": "```javascript\n    WOQL.isa(\"v:EdgeId\", \"AffectsEdge\")\n        .triple(\"v:EdgeId\", \"source\", \"v:NodeA\")\n        .triple(\"v:EdgeId\", \"target\", \"v:NodeB\")\n    ```",
    "type": "code",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK90005",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK90005",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90003",
    "text": "This single query automatically fetches all `AffectsEdge` instances **and** all domain-specific `BlocksEdge` instances seamlessly, with strict typing constraints.",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "### C. Transducer Extension (Pipeline & Class Overrides)",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK90006",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90007",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90008"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK8R007",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90006/props/StringProp/GjHNFdkuung7WqFS",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90006/props/StringProp/pVfF37bZ6rKgZGVc",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "Because transducers are TypeScript logic, they extend via standard programming patterns:",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK90007",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK90007",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90006",
    "text": "**Pipeline Composition**: Using tools like `unified.js`, the core provides a base pipeline (`unified().use(remarkParse)`). A Domain KG injects its own specific plugins (`.use(domainSpecificYamlPlugin)`) into the chain.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZK90008",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZK90008",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZK90006",
    "text": "**OOP Class Inheritance**: A domain script can extend a core parser class (`class ArchitectureTransducer extends BaseMarkdownTransducer`) to override specific parsing behaviors.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Document Root",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA0000",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0001"
    ],
    "parent": "ArtifactNode/00C7BJX6JG000",
    "type": "root",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "# Aperas Fractal Ontology - Implementation Plan",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA0001",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0002",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000E",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000M"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0000",
    "text": "This plan outlines the steps to refactor the Aperas Knowledge Graph codebase to implement the fractal block-tree ontology designed in `Aperas-core-ontology-design.md`. Stage 1 is fully implemented and live-verified; Stage 2 is implemented except items 4 (Link Extraction) and 5 (Title vs. Text Split), which remain open; Stage 3 (Database & UI Alignment) hasn't started. See `Aperas-dev-status.md` for current status and `Aperas-architecture.md` for the as-built reference. Node identity evolved past what Stage 2 anticipated (content-addressed hashing was tried and superseded by Snowflake-style ids — see `Aperas-core-ontology-design.md` Appendix F); this plan is kept as a historical record, not a live checklist.",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "## Stage 1: Core Schema Overhaul",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA0002",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0003",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0004",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0005",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0006",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000A"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0001",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0002/props/StringProp/3Nq1ZxuA2zhE1rpi",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "true"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0002/props/StringProp/cNWMhc4adMZC4W5q",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "**Target Files**: Create `web/src/lib/schema.json` and delete `web/src/lib/schema.ts`",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA0003",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA0003",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0002",
    "text": "**Eliminate `schema.ts`**: The current `schema.ts` file contains useless TypeScript interfaces that type the TerminusDB schema metadata (e.g., `docId: \"xsd:string\"`). This is a double-maintenance anti-pattern. We will delete `schema.ts` entirely.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA0004",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA0004",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0002",
    "text": "**Create `schema.json`**: Create a pure, static JSON array file representing the raw JSON-LD schema required by TerminusDB.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA0005",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA0005",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0002",
    "text": "**Clean Slate**: Do not port over the legacy `DocumentNode`, `SpanNode`, or `TripleAssertion` definitions to the new JSON file.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA0006",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA0006",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0007",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0008",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0009"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0002",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0006/props/StringProp/235mQ7lqt0sA_Lrn",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0006/props/StringProp/L81L2LHfGPwYt4vI",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "text": "**Implement Lineage (in `schema.json`)**:",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA0007",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA0007",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0006",
    "text": "Define `BaseNode` (Abstract class, `links: Set<BaseLink>`).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA0008",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA0008",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0006",
    "text": "Define `BaseLink` (Inherits `BaseNode`, adds `target: BaseNode`).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA0009",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA0009",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0006",
    "text": "Define `BaseEdge` (Inherits `BaseLink`, adds `source: BaseNode`).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA000A",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000A",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000B",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000C",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000D"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0002",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000A/props/StringProp/DwISEJaCFwtECk00",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000A/props/StringProp/bfmbGiagENyotUCc",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "**Implement Topology (in `schema.json`)**:",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA000B",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000B",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000A",
    "text": "Define `FolderNode` (Inherits `BaseNode`, adds `title`, `path`, `text`, `children: List<BaseNode>`).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA000C",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000C",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000A",
    "text": "Define `BlockNode` (Inherits `BaseNode`, adds `title`, `text`, `children: List<BlockNode>`, `unfolded: boolean`).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA000D",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000D",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000A",
    "text": "Define `ArtifactNode` (adds `path`, `contentHash`, `root: BlockNode`).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "## Stage 2: Ingestion & AST Parser Refactoring",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000E",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000F",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000G",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000H",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000J",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000K"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0001",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000E/props/StringProp/1kw_4xvDNzYZbhC0",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "true"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000E/props/StringProp/bZLzocKq878ijG_v",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "text": "**Target File**: `web/src/lib/astParser.ts` and `web/src/lib/artifacts.ts`",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA000F",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000F",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000E",
    "text": "**Directory Traversal & Folder Ingestion**: Refactor `artifacts.ts` to ingest folder structures as `FolderNode`s. If a `README.md` exists in a folder, its content is fully ingested into the `FolderNode` (extracting the abstract into `text` and prepending its parsed children to the folder's `children`). Do not expose `README.md` as a separate `ArtifactNode`.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA000G",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000G",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000E",
    "text": "**Fractal Tree Generation**: Refactor the markdown transducer to output an infinitely nested tree of `BlockNode`s rather than a flat, positional list.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA000H",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000H",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000E",
    "text": "**Content-Addressed IDs**: Replace positional ID generation (`doc1_block1`) with deterministic content hashing (combining parent context and block content).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA000J",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000J",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000E",
    "text": "**Link Extraction**: Modify the parser to extract inline Markdown links and properties, storing them structurally as `BaseLink` objects in the `BlockNode.links` array.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA000K",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000K",
    "children": [],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000E",
    "text": "**Title vs. Text Split**: Implement the ingestion logic for `title` vs `text`. (For headings: title is heading text, text is body. For normal blocks: fallback to first line or ID until the AI summarization agent is integrated).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "## Stage 3: Database & UI Alignment",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000M",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000N"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA0001",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00C7BJZMA000N",
    "blockId": "00C7BJZMA000N",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000P",
      "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000Q"
    ],
    "parent": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000M",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000N/props/StringProp/HvStpHDbyH1F0UlJ",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000N/props/StringProp/UZDP6OfijvK1tbT9",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "true"
      }
    ],
    "text": "1. **Database Sync**: Push the new schema to TerminusDB and verify class inheritance (`isa` subsumption) and properties.\n2. **Projection Engines & Traversal**: \n   *   Update WOQL/GraphQL queries to support BFS traversal seamlessly across `FolderNode`, `ArtifactNode`, and `BlockNode` boundaries.\n   *   Stub or update the Markdown generation logic to respect the `unfolded` property and serialize `FolderNode` block children back into `README.md`s.\n   *   Update SolidJS UI tree components to render the polymorphic hierarchy smoothly (Folder -> File -> Block).\n   *   Prepare UI components to handle the \"Hover Preview\" of link targets.",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C7BJZMA000P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
